<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW" class="dark">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>PAPAYA 智能數位學習院 | 學生生產力與 AI 資源中心</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            darkMode: 'class',
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        brand: {
                            50: '#f0fdfa',
                            100: '#ccfbf1',
                            500: '#14b8a6',
                            600: '#0d9488',
                            700: '#0f766e',
                            800: '#115e59',
                            900: '#134e4a',
                        },
                        darkBg: '#0b0f19',
                        darkCard: '#151d30',
                        darkBorder: '#222f47'
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@300;400;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif;
            background-color: #0b0f19;
            color: #f3f4f6;
        }
        /* 隱藏滾動條但保持功能 */
        .no-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar {
            display: none;
        }
        .no-scrollbar {
            -ms-overflow-style: none;
            scrollbar-width: none;
        }
        /* Anki 3D 卡片翻轉效果 */
        .card-container {
            perspective: 1000px;
        }
        .card-inner {
            transition: transform 0.6s;
            transform-style: preserve-3d;
        }
        .card-flipped {
            transform: rotateY(180deg);
        }
        .card-front, .card-back {
            backface-visibility: hidden;
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
        }
        .card-back {
            transform: rotateY(180deg);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col antialiased selection:bg-brand-500 selection:text-white">

    <!-- 頂部通知導覽 -->
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-50 bg-darkBg/90 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-darkBorder transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <div class="p-2.5 bg-brand-500/10 rounded-xl border border-brand-500/30">
                    <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253" />
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-lg font-bold tracking-wider bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-500 to-teal-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">PAPAYA 智能數位學習院</h1>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">專為學生打造的一站式生產力與 AI 知識庫</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <nav class="hidden md:flex space-x-1 text-sm font-medium">
                <button onclick="switchTab('dashboard')" class="nav-tab px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-brand-500 bg-brand-500/10 transition-colors" id="tab-dashboard">
                    主頁儀表板
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('resources')" class="nav-tab px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors" id="tab-resources">
                    精選資源庫
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('faq')" class="nav-tab px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors" id="tab-faq">
                    常見問答(FAQ)
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('chat')" class="nav-tab px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors" id="tab-chat">
                    NotebookLM 對話
                </button>
            </nav>

            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <div class="relative hidden sm:block">
                    <input type="text" id="global-search" oninput="handleGlobalSearch(this.value)" placeholder="搜尋工具、知識、攻略..." class="w-64 bg-darkCard border border-darkBorder rounded-xl pl-9 pr-4 py-1.5 text-xs text-gray-200 placeholder-gray-500 focus:outline-none focus:border-brand-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-brand-500 transition-all">
                    <span class="absolute left-3 top-2.5 text-gray-500">
                        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"/></svg>
                    </span>
                </div>
                
                <!-- 手機選單按鈕 -->
                <button onclick="toggleMobileMenu()" class="md:hidden p-2 rounded-xl bg-darkCard border border-darkBorder hover:bg-white/5 text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors">
                    <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16m-7 6h7"/></svg>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- 手機版導覽選單 -->
    <div id="mobile-menu" class="hidden md:hidden fixed inset-x-0 top-16 bg-darkBg/95 border-b border-darkBorder z-40 px-4 py-4 space-y-2 backdrop-blur-md">
        <div class="relative mb-3">
            <input type="text" id="mobile-global-search" oninput="handleGlobalSearch(this.value)" placeholder="搜尋工具、知識、攻略..." class="w-full bg-darkCard border border-darkBorder rounded-xl pl-9 pr-4 py-2 text-sm text-gray-200 focus:outline-none focus:border-brand-500">
            <span class="absolute left-3 top-3 text-gray-500">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"/></svg>
            </span>
        </div>
        <button onclick="switchTab('dashboard'); toggleMobileMenu()" class="w-full text-left px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-brand-500 bg-brand-500/10 font-medium">主頁儀表板</button>
        <button onclick="switchTab('resources'); toggleMobileMenu()" class="w-full text-left px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-gray-300 hover:bg-white/5 font-medium">精選資源庫</button>
        <button onclick="switchTab('faq'); toggleMobileMenu()" class="w-full text-left px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-gray-300 hover:bg-white/5 font-medium">常見問答(FAQ)</button>
        <button onclick="switchTab('chat'); toggleMobileMenu()" class="w-full text-left px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-gray-300 hover:bg-white/5 font-medium">NotebookLM 對話</button>
    </div>

    <!-- 主體內容區 -->
    <main class="flex-grow max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 w-full">

        <!-- 1. 主頁儀表板 -->
        <section id="section-dashboard" class="space-y-8 animate-fade-in">
            <!-- 英雄廣告區 -->
            <div class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-darkCard to-brand-900/20 border border-darkBorder rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
                <div class="absolute -right-12 -bottom-12 w-64 h-64 bg-brand-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
                <div class="absolute -left-12 -top-12 w-64 h-64 bg-teal-500/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
                
                <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl space-y-4">
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-brand-500/10 text-brand-500 border border-brand-500/20">
                        <span class="w-2 h-2 mr-2 rounded-full bg-brand-500 animate-pulse"></span>
                        學術研究與報告發表必備武器
                    </span>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
                        用對 AI 與智慧工具，<br class="hidden sm:inline">讓你的大腦開啟高效開掛學習模式！
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                        本系統深度整合了 PAPAYA 電腦教室精選的三十套現代化生產力課程。不論是期末簡報排版、單字記憶、論文程式開發，還是日常自動化工作流程，都能在此找到最適合你的數位軍火庫。
                    </p>
                    <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                        <button onclick="switchTab('resources')" class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-brand-500 hover:bg-brand-600 active:bg-brand-700 text-white font-medium rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-brand-500/20 transition-all flex items-center space-x-2 text-sm">
                            <span>探索 35+ 數位資源</span>
                            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
                        </button>
                        <button onclick="switchTab('chat')" class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-darkCard hover:bg-white/5 active:bg-white/10 border border-darkBorder text-gray-300 hover:text-white font-medium rounded-xl transition-all text-sm flex items-center space-x-2">
                            <span>直接與知識庫對話</span>
                            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z"/></svg>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 四大主體方向指引 -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
                <div class="bg-darkCard hover:bg-darkCard/80 border border-darkBorder hover:border-brand-500/30 p-5 rounded-2xl transition-all group cursor-pointer" onclick="filterResources('ai-coding')">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-base">本機 AI 與網頁開發</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">無痛上手 Gemma 4、LM Studio 及 Hugging Face，使用 Claude Code 實現 Vibe Coding 動嘴寫網頁與 Chrome 插件。</p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-darkCard hover:bg-darkCard/80 border border-darkBorder hover:border-brand-500/30 p-5 rounded-2xl transition-all group cursor-pointer" onclick="filterResources('pkm')">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253" /></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-base">知識管理與考試神器</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">利用 Notion 資料庫及 Anytype 的離線隱私保護建置個人外掛大腦，結合 Anki 間歇重複卡片完美應付各種大型考驗。</p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-darkCard hover:bg-darkCard/80 border border-darkBorder hover:border-brand-500/30 p-5 rounded-2xl transition-all group cursor-pointer" onclick="filterResources('automation')">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-green-500/10 text-green-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-base">辦公流程與自動化</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">用 Make.com 及 n8n 將常用 Apps 與 AI 串連，自動整理作業、備份郵件、建構 Line 免費 24H 智能問答助理。</p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-darkCard hover:bg-darkCard/80 border border-darkBorder hover:border-brand-500/30 p-5 rounded-2xl transition-all group cursor-pointer" onclick="filterResources('design')">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-base">簡報排版與 3D 影音</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">透過 Figma、Canva、Gamma 大師級簡報和 PPT 視差效果驚豔全場；結合 Suno/Kling 與 SketchUp 釋放極限創意。</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 核心互動版塊一：適配工具評估問卷 -->
            <div class="bg-darkCard border border-darkBorder rounded-2xl p-6 relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6">
                    <div class="space-y-2 max-w-2xl">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center">
                            <span class="p-1 bg-brand-500/20 text-brand-500 rounded-lg mr-2.5">
                                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
                            </span>
                            學術任務神隊友 - 工具智能挑選推薦器
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                            面對各種期末報告、單字記憶、程式撰寫或專案整理，感到選擇困難嗎？花 20 秒回答 3 個簡單問題，系統將即時為你推薦最適合你目前學習情境與硬體配備的神級工具！
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <button onclick="openWizardModal()" class="w-full md:w-auto px-5 py-2.5 bg-brand-500 hover:bg-brand-600 font-semibold rounded-xl text-white text-xs tracking-wider transition-colors flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 shadow-lg">
                            <span>開始智能評估</span>
                            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/></svg>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 核心互動版塊二：Anki 記憶閃卡實戰與 Python 變數命名診斷 -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                <!-- Anki 記憶卡模擬 -->
                <div class="bg-darkCard border border-darkBorder rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col justify-between h-[360px]">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded-md bg-brand-500/10 text-brand-500 border border-brand-500/20">Anki 學習閃卡</span>
                            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">點擊卡片翻轉複習</span>
                        </div>
                        <button onclick="nextAnkiCard()" class="text-xs text-brand-500 hover:text-brand-400 font-medium flex items-center space-x-1">
                            <span>下一張</span>
                            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 3D 翻轉卡片 -->
                    <div class="flex-grow flex items-center justify-center">
                        <div class="card-container w-full max-w-sm h-48 cursor-pointer" onclick="flipAnkiCard()">
                            <div id="anki-card-inner" class="card-inner w-full h-full relative">
                                <!-- 卡片正面 -->
                                <div class="card-front bg-darkBg border-2 border-darkBorder hover:border-brand-500/50 rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-lg">
                                    <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">正面提問 (Question)</div>
                                    <div id="anki-front-text" class="text-lg font-bold text-white text-center py-4">
                                        LoRA 是一種什麼樣的 AI 技術？它的優勢是什麼？
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 text-center">點擊卡片以查看背面解析</div>
                                </div>
                                <!-- 卡片背面 -->
                                <div class="card-back bg-brand-950/20 border-2 border-brand-500/50 rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-lg">
                                    <div class="text-xs text-brand-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">背面解答 (Answer)</div>
                                    <div id="anki-back-text" class="text-sm text-gray-200 py-2 leading-relaxed">
                                        LoRA 是一種「微調模型」技術，可以讓 AI 生成特定風格（如卡通貼紙、特定面孔）。優點是檔案小、對電腦硬體效能需求大幅降低！
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="text-[10px] text-brand-400 text-center">熟記此卡片！點擊卡片可再次翻回正面</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Python 變數命名診斷 -->
                <div class="bg-darkCard border border-darkBorder rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col justify-between h-[360px]">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 mb-3">
                            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded-md bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 border border-purple-500/20">Python 程式診斷</span>
                            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">基礎語法互動測試</span>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-base">Python 變數命名合法性檢查</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                            在 Python 變數入門中，命名的不當會直接引發編譯錯誤。請在下方輸入你想測試的變數名稱，我們將即時進行規則檢測。
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="my-4 space-y-3">
                        <div class="relative">
                            <input type="text" id="python-var-input" oninput="checkPythonVariable(this.value)" placeholder="例如：user_age, 2nd_place, class..." class="w-full bg-darkBg border border-darkBorder rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm text-gray-200 focus:outline-none focus:border-purple-500">
                        </div>
                        <div id="python-var-feedback" class="p-3 bg-darkBg rounded-xl border border-darkBorder flex items-start space-x-2 text-xs text-gray-400">
                            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
                            <span id="python-feedback-text">請輸入變數名稱進行規則驗證</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
                        * 規則提示：不能以數字開頭、不能包含空格、不能使用保留關鍵字（如 if, for, class 等）、區分大小寫。
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 2. 精選資源庫 -->
        <section id="section-resources" class="hidden space-y-6 animate-fade-in">
            <!-- 資源庫頭部 -->
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-wide flex items-center">
                        精選生產力與 AI 資源庫
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">涵蓋各大名校推崇之頂級 AI 對話、知識建構與影音 3D 設計工具</p>
                </div>
                <!-- 分類篩選按鈕 -->
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 no-scrollbar overflow-x-auto pb-1">
